@startuml

[*] --> ShutDown : restart and begin running from a shut down condition

ShutDown --> ConfigurationMode : changes or power-saving settings required

ConfigurationMode : entry / Enter configuration mode
ConfigurationMode : do / Configure system
ConfigurationMode : exit / Complete configuration

ConfigurationMode --> Running : configuration completed

Running : entry / Collect data when triggered by the clock while running
Running : do / Prepare and send out a weather summary upon request
Running : do / Check its own status and transmit the result upon request
Running : exit / Return to running state after performing an activity

Running --> ControlledMode : remote control input

ControlledMode : entry / Move into controlled mode through remote control
ControlledMode : do / NIL
ControlledMode : exit / NIL

ControlledMode --> ShutDown : shutdown command given while running

ShutDown --> [*] : shut down condition

@enduml
